              "category": "usage",
              "presentation": "core",
              "title": "簡短否定回應 Non ancora",
              "sourceCueIds": [
                "c3"
              ],
              "contextCueIds": [],
              "explanation": "Non ancora 可單獨作為簡明回答，表示「還沒」或「尚未」，常見於回應以 già（已經）詢問動作是否完成的問句。",
              "sourceSpans": [
